# Kalah from setup to the end of a best-of-three match against the Casual
# computer. The computer plays the same move for the same position, so
# these pits win both rounds every time.
expect Board games
tap Kalah
expect Sow four stones from each of six pits.
expect Moves first
tap Rules
expect Your six pits are the row nearest you
expect When one side is empty, most stones in the stores wins.
clean
shot kalah-rules
tap Back
expect Computer strength
tap Casual
tap Start game
expect Your move
expect Tap one of your six non-empty pits to sow counter-clockwise.
expect You 0 · Computer 0
# A store and the computer's pits are not the player's to sow.
tap-id cell-6
expect Choose a non-empty pit on your side. Stores cannot be selected.
tap-id cell-9
expect Choose a non-empty pit on your side.
tap-id game-undo
expect Nothing to undo yet.
# Four stones from the third pit end in the store, which earns another turn.
tap-id cell-2
expect Last stone in your store: take the extra turn.
clean
shot kalah-extra-turn
tap-id cell-3
tap-id cell-4
tap-id cell-1
tap-id cell-4
tap-id cell-0
tap-id cell-3
tap-id cell-4
tap-id cell-5
tap-id cell-5
clean
shot kalah-mid-game
# A game in progress is saved on every move and offered back on reopening.
restart
wait-for Resume Kalah
expect Board games
clean
shot kalah-resume-offered
tap Resume Kalah
expect Game resumed.
expect You 0 · Computer 0
tap-id cell-2
tap-id cell-5
tap-id cell-3
tap-id cell-5
tap-id cell-4
tap-id cell-5
tap-id cell-1
tap-id cell-5
tap-id cell-2
tap-id cell-3
tap-id cell-5
tap-id cell-4
tap-id cell-5
tap-id cell-0
tap-id cell-0
tap-id cell-1
tap-id cell-2
expect You win
expect You 1 · Computer 0
expect The match is the best of three rounds. Next round plays on.
expect Next round
clean
shot kalah-round-won
tap-id cell-0
expect The round is over. Next round plays another.
tap Moves
expect 1. You: sowed pit 3
expect 3. Computer: sowed pit 2
clean
shot kalah-moves
tap-id record-next
expect 20. You: sowed pit 6
clean
shot kalah-moves-page-two
tap-id record-previous
expect 1. You: sowed pit 3
tap-id 4294967295
expect Next round
tap Next round
expect Tap one of your six non-empty pits to sow counter-clockwise.
expect You 1 · Computer 0
tap-id cell-2
tap-id cell-3
tap-id cell-4
tap-id cell-1
tap-id cell-4
tap-id cell-0
tap-id cell-3
tap-id cell-4
tap-id cell-5
tap-id cell-5
tap-id cell-2
tap-id cell-5
tap-id cell-3
tap-id cell-5
tap-id cell-4
tap-id cell-5
tap-id cell-1
tap-id cell-5
tap-id cell-2
tap-id cell-3
tap-id cell-5
tap-id cell-4
tap-id cell-5
tap-id cell-0
tap-id cell-0
tap-id cell-1
tap-id cell-2
expect You win
expect You 2 · Computer 0
expect Match over, 2–0. New game, in the menu at the top, starts another.
expect-missing Next round
clean
shot kalah-match-won
tap-id cell-0
expect The match is over. New game, in the menu at the top, starts another.
# Undo reopens the deciding round and takes the point back with it.
tap Undo
expect Your last move and the computer's reply are taken back.
expect You 1 · Computer 0
tap-id cell-2
expect You 2 · Computer 0
expect Match over, 2–0.
restart
wait-for Resume Kalah
tap Resume Kalah
expect You win
expect You 2 · Computer 0
tap-id game-more
tap New game
expect Computer strength
expect-missing Starting replaces
tap Start game
expect You 0 · Computer 0
expect Your move
